- Raw `+0x28`, `+0x38`, and `+0x50` values are exposed as explicitly meaning-unverified fields; no semantic claim was made for them.
- The Lua surface exports only lowercase `capabilities` and `snapshot`, and the consistency check confirms they do not duplicate NWScript routine names.

